00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.020
Rob is singing, I mean,
he is singing lyrics here,

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.990
like if you watch this with subtitles,

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.462
like this is a lumberjack song.

00:04:11.462 --> 00:04:13.242
